  "title": "EPC Document Review Is Not a Search Problem",
  "summary": "In the seven weeks before this was published, Trimble bought Document Crunch and Trunk Tools shipped its Autodesk Forma integration. The AI-for-construction-submittals category, in the commercial sense, is now claimed. The EPC technical review surface — vendor documents against NACE, API, ASME, and a project specification — is a different shape, and it is still mostly unaddressed.",
